@startuml Jira Task Creator Overview

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #E8F4FD
    BorderColor #2196F3
    FontColor #333333
    ArrowColor #666666
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #FFC107
}

title **Jira Task Creator** \nAutomated Task Generation Tool

|#LightBlue|User|
start
:Write a **brief description**\nof the work you need done;
note right
  Example:
  "Add login page
  with password reset"
end note

|#LightGreen|AI Assistant (GPT-4o)|
:Reads your description and\n**generates a complete task**;
note right
  The AI creates:
  • Clear title
  • Detailed description
  • Acceptance criteria
  • Story points estimate
  • Suggested category
end note

|#LightBlue|User|
:Review the **generated task**\nin the preview panel;

if (Looks good?) then (Yes)
  :Optionally add:\n• Assignee name\n• Epic link;
  
  |#LightCoral|Jira System|
  :Click **"Create in Jira"**\nto send the task;
  
  :✅ **Task created!**\nReceive link to new issue;
  stop
  
else (No)
  |#LightBlue|User|
  :Edit your description\nand try again;
  note right
    Refine your input
    for better results
  end note
  end
endif

legend right
  **What you need:**
  ─────────────────
  • GitHub account (for AI access)
  • Jira account (to create tasks)
  
  **The tool handles:**
  ─────────────────
  • Writing professional descriptions
  • Formatting for Jira
  • Setting correct fields
endlegend

@enduml
